      "text": "[Fictional review] Invented systems-nerd take: twelve forgeable towers, fourteen bosses with bespoke mechanics, monster affixes, seven regions and a daily seed with a scoreboard, all static-hosted with 1,700 tests? Absurd scope for a fan prototype."
    }
