      "local_path": "screenshots/1a9be8971bc9aa4a29ff06beeb01d8ba880fda8dad906b5549790fd0c5c5cefb.png",
      "sha256": "1a9be8971bc9aa4a29ff06beeb01d8ba880fda8dad906b5549790fd0c5c5cefb",
      "downloaded_at": "2026-09-28T04:46:48.725192+00:00"
    }
  ],
  "source_analysis": [
    {
      "finding": "Repository is hamilton-junior/osrs-tower-defense, described as 'OSRS Tower Defense prototype', TypeScript primary language, homepage set to the playable GitHub Pages URL, 3 stars and 2 forks.",
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/hamilton-junior/osrs-tower-defense"
    },
    {
      "finding": "Game runs in the browser with no server; every sprite and sound is baked from the real OSRS game cache via scripts, nothing hot-linked; playable link with browser-local progress and transferable save codes.",
      "url": "https://github.com/hamilton-junior/osrs-tower-defense/blob/main/README.md"
    },
    {
      "finding": "Run structure: one 45x20 board at fixed 1440x640 with a different road every run, 20 lives, boss every tenth wave, seven regions to choose between after bosses, win at wave 130 with Endless after.",
      "url": "https://github.com/hamilton-junior/osrs-tower-defense/blob/main/README.md"
    },
    {
      "finding": "Two modes (Classic pure TD; Roguelite with gold-bought reward cards and boss-paid rule-rewriting relics) and seven Combat-Achievement difficulties up to Grandmaster (2.8x HP, 30% less gold, five lives).",
      "url": "https://github.com/hamilton-junior/osrs-tower-defense/blob/main/README.md"
    },
    {
      "finding": "Six base towers with OSRS-gear tier ladders fusing into six special weapons; 61 monsters and 14 bosses with bespoke mechanics (Zulrah forms, Jad healers, Corporeal siphon) plus Volatile/Warded affixes; wizard spellbooks; OSRS skills without timing or APM demands.",
      "url": "https://github.com/hamilton-junior/osrs-tower-defense/blob/main/README.md"
    },
    {
      "finding": "Metagame: Collection Log, rotatable-model Bestiary, Combat Achievements, per-region Diaries, boss pets, permanent Essence Shop, and a shared-seed daily challenge with best-score board.",
      "url": "https://github.com/hamilton-junior/osrs-tower-defense/blob/main/README.md"
    },
    {
      "finding": "Stack is Next.js 15.4.11 App Router + React 19 + TypeScript + Canvas 2D + Tailwind v4, static export to GitHub Pages with no backend; 1,703 Vitest tests across 70 files; imperative engine plus stateless renderer bridged by GameRoot.",
      "url": "https://github.com/hamilton-junior/osrs-tower-defense/blob/main/README.md"
    },
    {
      "finding": "Mouse/pointer play is core: tile clicks arm and spend builds, clicks pin enemy panels, pointer drives the placement ghost; keyboard is supported via an arrow-key placement cursor plus keydown/keyup handlers and hotkeys.",
      "url": "https://github.com/hamilton-junior/osrs-tower-defense/blob/main/components/game/GameRoot.tsx"
