    {
      "finding": "Live Pages URL returns the game shell (title plus Play link) and is referenced as GAME_URL in the app source; as a JS-rendered Canvas app its full playability could not be verified from a static fetch.",
      "url": "https://hamilton-junior.github.io/osrs-tower-defense/"
    },
    {
      "finding": "No catalog entry matches this game: no existing game references this repository, playable URL, or project; the only tower-defense entry (Taipo) is a different project by a different author.",
